      "text_id": "H58-gua_ci",
      "text_type": "gua_ci",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "兑：亨，利贞。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-tuan",
      "text_type": "tuan",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "兑，说也。刚中而柔外，说以利贞，是以顺乎天而应乎人。说以先民，民忘其劳；说以犯难，民忘其死。说之大，民劝矣哉！",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-da_xiang",
      "text_type": "da_xiang",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "丽泽，兑。君子以朋友讲习。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-yao_ci-L1",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": "初九",
      "candidate_text": "和兑，吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-yao_ci-L2",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": "九二",
      "candidate_text": "孚兑，吉，悔亡。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-yao_ci-L3",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": "六三",
      "candidate_text": "来兑，凶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-yao_ci-L4",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": "九四",
      "candidate_text": "商兑未宁，介疾有喜。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-yao_ci-L5",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": "九五",
      "candidate_text": "孚于剥，有厉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-yao_ci-L6",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": "上六",
      "candidate_text": "引兑。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-xiao_xiang-L1",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“和兑”之吉，行未疑也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-xiao_xiang-L2",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“孚兑”之吉，信志也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-xiao_xiang-L3",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“来兑”之凶，位不当也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-xiao_xiang-L4",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "九四之喜，有庆也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-xiao_xiang-L5",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“孚于剥”，位正当也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H58-xiao_xiang-L6",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "上六引兑，未光也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    }
  ]
}
